    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "The story revolves around Tomoya Mizuhara, a 13-year-old boy who suddenly gains a big sister when his father remarries. 17-year-old Ichika is a little strange, and her affection for Tomoya is rather overwhelming, if not scary. On top of things, Ichika's friend Ruri is the ultimate sadist. Then there is Ichika's big-breasted quarter-Japanese friend Marina.",
        "jpn": "水原朋也13才。 父親の再婚によって変な姉・水原一香17才が出来ました。 お姉ちゃんからの愛が…重い…。"
    },
